      "cli_help": "usage: askme.py [-h] [--prompt-file PROMPT_FILE]\n                                   [--working-dir WORKING_DIR]\n                                   [--result-json RESULT_JSON]\n                                   [--reasoning-policy {gated,off}]\n                                   [--capability-profile {generic-feature-scale-v1,legacy-e4b-m1-16k-v1}]\n                                   [--max-replans MAX_REPLANS]\n                                   [--max-tasks MAX_TASKS]\n                                   [--max-steps MAX_STEPS]\n                                   [--goal-context-chars GOAL_CONTEXT_CHARS]\n                                   [prompt]\n\nRun AskMe against an isolated or existing working directory.\n\npositional arguments:\n  prompt                Task request\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --prompt-file PROMPT_FILE\n                        Read the task request from this file\n  --working-dir WORKING_DIR\n                        Existing workspace for the agent\n  --result-json RESULT_JSON\n                        Write the structured run result here\n  --reasoning-policy {gated,off}\n                        Explicit-reasoning policy (default: gated)\n  --capability-profile {generic-feature-scale-v1,legacy-e4b-m1-16k-v1}\n                        Model-facing budget/context profile (default:\n                        LLM_CAPABILITY_PROFILE or generic-feature-scale-v1)\n  --max-replans MAX_REPLANS\n                        Maximum planning attempts, including the initial plan\n  --max-tasks MAX_TASKS\n                        Maximum tasks accepted from each plan\n  --max-steps MAX_STEPS\n                        Maximum executor steps per task attempt\n  --goal-context-chars GOAL_CONTEXT_CHARS\n                        Goal characters available to executor and task\n                        replanner (default: AGENT_GOAL_CONTEXT_CHARS or 300)\n",
